---
---

<section class="bg-zinc-50/50 border-b border-zinc-200/80 py-16 lg:py-20">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 sm:gap-8 items-stretch">
      
      <!-- Feature 1: Toko Fisik -->
      <div class="bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-3xl p-7 sm:p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between space-y-6">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-800 border border-emerald-200/60">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-600"></span>
            Toko & Gudang Fisik di Malang
          </span>
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-zinc-900 tracking-tight leading-snug">
            Datang, Lihat Sampel, dan Bandingkan Langsung
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed">
            Tidak hanya melihat foto di layar. Anda dapat datang langsung ke gudang kami, memegang fisik sampel plastik UV, mengecek ketebalan pipa, dan berdiskusi teknis.
          </p>
          <div class="pt-3 border-t border-zinc-100 space-y-2 text-xs text-zinc-600">
            <p class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span>📍 Buring, Kedungkandang, Kota Malang</span>
            </p>
            <p class="text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed">
              Tersedia sampel fisik plastik UV, paranet, insect net, perlengkapan irigasi, dan komponen greenhouse lainnya.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-2">
          <a
            href="/lokasi/"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-700 hover:text-emerald-800 group"
          >
            <span>Lihat Lokasi & Jam Buka Toko</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true" class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 2: Material Khusus Tropis -->
      <div class="bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-3xl p-7 sm:p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between space-y-6">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-800 border border-emerald-200/60">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-600"></span>
            Kualitas Terstandar & Presisi
          </span>
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-zinc-900 tracking-tight leading-snug">
            Material Terkurasi untuk Iklim Tropis Ekstrem
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed">
            Kami menyediakan material berspesifikasi industri yang tahan terhadap radiasi UV tinggi, kelembapan, dan terpaan angin tropis Indonesia.
          </p>
          
          <div class="pt-3 border-t border-zinc-100 grid grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 text-xs">
            <div class="bg-zinc-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-zinc-100">
              <span class="font-bold text-zinc-900 text-[11px] block">Plastik UV 200μ</span>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-zinc-500 mt-0.5">UV stabilizer hingga 14% & 20%</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-zinc-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-zinc-100">
              <span class="font-bold text-zinc-900 text-[11px] block">Paranet Shading</span>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-zinc-500 mt-0.5">Kerapatan 65% - 75% tahan lapuk</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-zinc-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-zinc-100">
              <span class="font-bold text-zinc-900 text-[11px] block">Insect Net 50 Mesh</span>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-zinc-500 mt-0.5">Penghalau kutu kebul & trips</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-zinc-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-zinc-100">
              <span class="font-bold text-zinc-900 text-[11px] block">Pipa Galvanis Hot-Dip</span>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-zinc-500 mt-0.5">Anti-karat 10-15+ tahun</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-2">
          <a
            href="/produk/perlengkapan-greenhouse/"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-700 hover:text-emerald-800 group"
          >
            <span>Telusuri Seluruh Material</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true" class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 3: Layanan Terpadu -->
      <div class="bg-white border border-zinc-200/80 rounded-3xl p-7 sm:p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between space-y-6">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-800 border border-emerald-200/60">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-600"></span>
            Layanan Terpadu & Fleksibel
          </span>
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-zinc-900 tracking-tight leading-snug">
            Beli Materialnya, atau Serahkan Instalasinya
          </h2>
          <div class="space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              <strong class="text-zinc-900 font-semibold">Punya tim tukang lokal?</strong> Beli material eceran atau grosir, kami kirim paket knockdown lengkap dengan blueprint perakitan.
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong class="text-zinc-900 font-semibold">Ingin terima kunci siap pakai?</strong> Tim teknisi aplikator kami siap merakit langsung di lahan kebun Anda di seluruh Indonesia.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-3 border-t border-zinc-100 space-y-2 text-xs">
            <div class="p-3 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-50 border border-zinc-200/70 font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold text-zinc-800 flex items-center justify-between">
              <span>Opsi A: Beli Material</span>
              <span class="text-emerald-700 font-bold">Kirim Kargo</span>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-50/60 border border-emerald-200/60 font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold text-emerald-900 flex items-center justify-between">
              <span>Opsi B: Proyek Penuh</span>
              <span class="text-emerald-700 font-bold">Tim Lapangan</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-2">
          <a
            href="/jasa/pembuatan-greenhouse/"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-700 hover:text-emerald-800 group"
          >
            <span>Pelajari Jasa Rancang Bangun</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true" class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
